      "text": "Generally pathetic period by the Penguins. They had puck possession, but it's tough to score from Cranberry. And again, a defensive mess yields an easy goal. 3-1. Penguins got some late shots to improve their total but they had 3 irrelevant shots in the first 13 minutes.",
